        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>法国甜品介绍</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff8ec 0%, #fdf3e0 40%, #f7ead2 100%);\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    padding: 25px 20px 35px 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n  .left-col {\n    width: 105px;\n    flex: 0 0 105px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-right: 14px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 95px;\n    height: 78px;\n    margin: 0 auto 6px auto;\n    background: #fbe9d0;\n    border: 1px dashed #d8b878;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #a9752f;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 2px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .label {\n    color: #d98c2b;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .right-col {\n    flex: 1;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #3a3a3a;\n    text-align: justify;\n    padding-top: 4px;\n  }\n  .right-col .en {\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"left-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 白色圆饼糖果]</div>\n      <div class=\"label\">卡里颂糖</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"right-col\">\n      Calissons卡里颂糖是一种传统的法国糖果，由光滑、淡黄色、均匀的蜜饼（尤其是瓜仁和橙子）和杏仁粉组成，上面覆盖着一层薄薄的糖霜。它们的质地类似于杏仁软糖，但具有更浓郁的果味和明显的甜瓜味。通常呈杏仁状，长约五厘米。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"left-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 粉色卷状巧克力]</div>\n      <div class=\"label\">里昂枕巧克力</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"right-col\">\n      Coussin de Lyon是里昂高级手工巧克力，绿色外皮是杏仁泥，中间有深色色的直线，内馅是调了许多橙酒的黑巧克力馅。以用杏仁和巧克力、柑橘清香闻名于世。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"left-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 白碗中的蛋奶甜品]</div>\n      <div class=\"label\">漂浮岛</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"right-col\">\n      Île flottante 这个具有神秘又有趣名称的甜品是法国经典甜品之一。白白胖胖的蛋清在蛋奶做成的英式卡仕达酱上，就像是一座无人小岛。可爱又美味。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"left-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 柠檬奶油塔]</div>\n      <div class=\"label\">柠檬塔</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"right-col\">\n      Tarte au citron，一款历史悠久的美食，从南法城市Menton开始流行。每年的二、三月都会举办柠檬节，城中以柠檬与鲜花制作的花车游行最为盛名。在塔皮挤入柠檬奶油馅，再以蛋白饼或蛋白霜装饰，是现在常见的柠檬塔形式。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"left-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 红酒炖梨配香料]</div>\n      <div class=\"label\">红酒炖梨</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"right-col\">\n      Poire à la Beaujolaise，法国博若莱葡萄酒产区的传统甜点，果味红酒搭配糖或蜂蜜、丁香、朗姆、香草等香料煮梨，梨充分入味，甜软飘香。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
